## Integration rules

Before editing, check that the named backup matches the spec. If absent or different, stop and report the gap.
Edit only the named spec from these decisions. Keep everything not named.
If the numbered decision list or unverified-points list is missing, add it in one place and name that location in the application report.
Preserve decision numbers. Mark new decisions "needs confirmation".
Mark changed decisions "changed, needs a new confirmation".
Add acceptance criteria for new behavior. Map every round decision or finding to its resolution location.
For rejected findings, record the rejection and reason. Update unverified points and pending user choices.
Return applied decision IDs and unapplied IDs with reasons through the runtime. The lead saves them at the application report path above.
Do not silently settle user-owned choices.
